							author: "Orangejewce92"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Welcome To SM3!!\\nFew commands you may want to know!\\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\\n[TAB] Toggle on/off Vein miner\\n[ ` ] Use Vein Mine\\n[ P ] Look at an item in front of you or in your inv and press P to get pmmo stats\\n[ V ] Weapon Mastery\\n[ G ] Origin Primary Ability ---->\\n\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"[ R ] Combat roll\\n[ Z ] Zoom Feature\\n[ C ] Crawl/Prone\\n[ RIGHT ALT ] SkillTree\\n[ I ] Toggle inv on screen\\n[ K ] Disable Shaders\\n\\nOf course you can change these on your own in keybinds!\\n\\nEnjoy Sm3!\"}"
							]
							title: "操作说明"
